Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:14.24,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.09,0:00:17.49,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Back then, why did I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.18,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:17.99,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(529,520)\3c&H949991&}Welcome. This Is Your New Family Home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:23.02,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:24.40,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:25.49,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.49,0:02:26.25,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.59,0:02:30.40,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,How does MayoPan spend a \Nweek-long extended break?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.56,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Vlog day two!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:35.25,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,For my day off today...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:39.51,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Behold! Meal prep!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:42.28,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Is this a good angle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:47.64,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Oh, that's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:49.64,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:54.40,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,With Masaki gone, I thought we'd have \Na week off from shooting videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.83,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Well, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.83,0:03:00.32,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san told us to film what\N we do while we're on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:03.66,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,A vacation that we have to film \N{\i1}doesn't count{\i0} as a vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:08.59,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,B-But we only have three months left \Nuntil Mother's deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:10.82,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,After taking part in that \Nfestival and doing collabs,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:13.17,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,we've finally hit 400k subscribers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:16.17,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,We can't be taking a break \Nat a time like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:21.37,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'm sacrificing my beauty sleep \Nto work my butt off here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:23.45,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I think I deserve a little praise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:24.72,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I'm also...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.72,0:03:26.01,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:28.83,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Oh, you were still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:31.24,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,The more footage we have, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:32.77,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,W-Were we disrupting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:34.90,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:36.95,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You're stepping on Live-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:41.80,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,She seems awfully upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.38,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Snap out of it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:46.16,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama, are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:46.16,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\fax-0.25\fs16\pos(345.5,100)\frz350.2}Masaki <3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.54,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:56.24,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I {\i1}miss{\i0} you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:58.02,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,You know it's only been two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:03:58.94,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,How's today's footage?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:03.37,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Well, I finished making cuts, \Nbut it's a little long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.37,0:04:04.05,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:07.14,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll trim it down where I can \Nwhen I add the captions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:09.04,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'll send what I have, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:10.28,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Thanks. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:11.73,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, how's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:12.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:14.75,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It was her appendix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:16.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,She'll be out of the hospital in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.41,0:04:18.62,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:20.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sorry to duck out at such a critical time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:22.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,No, it's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.68,0:04:25.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It sure is lonely without you here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:29.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki, I really do—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:30.04,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:35.69,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,We should go to sleep soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:38.04,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,We'll start shooting again when the sun sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:39.34,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.59,0:04:46.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How do I deal with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.34,0:04:51.47,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I would have been fine on my own for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:52.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.36,0:04:56.61,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,If you were busy with NewTube stuff, \Nyou didn't have to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:04:58.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:00.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Mom asked me to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:03.87,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,My precious winter break...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:06.52,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I would have less chores\N to do if I were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:10.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I-I was gonna clean that up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:13.15,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,If I were alone in the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.15,0:05:17.50,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I could blast dance music every night \Nwhile busting out my sick moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:18.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:21.71,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'll handle the laundry, \Nso do the dishes at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:23.00,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:24.44,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.44,0:05:26.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sakura, do you watch NewTube?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:30.34,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:32.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Can you take a look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:48.44,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Still images?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.44,0:05:49.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:53.79,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I asked them to shoot vlogs on their days off,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:56.54,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but all I get back is stuff like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:06:02.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,They're a real wacky bunch, so I {\i1}thought{\i0} \Nthey'd be entertaining on their days off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:05.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But if I trash this footage, \Nwe won't have a video for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:07.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Uploading every day is a must!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.69,0:06:09.15,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:12.02,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I mean, it {\i1}does{\i0} feel like \Na realistic day off, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:13.81,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:25.44,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,How does MayoPan spend a\N week-long extended break?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:26.40,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Vlog!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:31.39,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Today, we're going on a drive to the \Nbest spot to enjoy a nighttime view!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:32.57,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:36.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The catch: we have to eat at every \Ndrive-through we come across.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:39.21,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Will our stomachs hold out until \Nwe reach our scenic destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:43.96,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,We'll shoot some amazing footage to use!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:46.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.19,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You're stiff as a board.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:50.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is it that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:52.11,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Can I stop now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:54.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not yet! A little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:57.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:07:00.82,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I don't trust you when you say "a little more."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:01.61,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:03.76,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You kept saying, "C'mon, just a little more,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.76,0:07:05.48,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,and then you'd eaten all my ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:07.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How long ago was {\i1}that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:08.66,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Literally yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:12.75,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:15.08,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:15.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:17.25,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:18.67,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:22.41,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You're Masaki's sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:24.40,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Oh, you look so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:25.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:26.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hey, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:28.96,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I've gotten to know your big sister very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:30.63,Default,Live,0,0,0,,My name's Live! From Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:37.55,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Her blood smells normal, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.55,0:07:40.27,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,That's rude to say to someone you've just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.27,0:07:42.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. Has she not told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.93,0:07:46.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm part of a NewTube channel with your sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:47.48,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.79,0:07:49.65,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hello. I'm Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:50.99,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:53.65,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Y-You can tell me what happened inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.65,0:07:54.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:58.92,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So this is Masaki's family home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:00.52,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The place that birthed Masaki's blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:01.75,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:05.31,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san, have you always lived here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:07.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No, this used to be my grandma's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:09.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We moved here after my parents got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:10.63,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:14.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Up until preschool, I used to live \Nclose to Banpai Manor, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:14.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:19.61,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So you mean I might've come across \Nteeny-tiny Masaki in the past?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.61,0:08:20.80,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's nothing short of fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:21.98,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:21.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\an7\fnTimes New Roman\c&H323C40&\3c&H323C40&\bord4}Fate
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.89,0:08:21.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\an7\fnTimes New Roman\c&H80FFFB&\3c&H2F1BCB&\bord2}Fate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So? Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:26.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to film \Nthat night view roadtrip?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:27.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We filmed it, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.48,Default,Live,0,0,0,,But also...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:31.11,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:35.34,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Oh! It's so pretty here at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:41.25,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1237,1)\alpha&H33&\an7\bord0\blur0.2\p1\c&H533221&\pos(343,23.5)\fscx282\fscy180}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.86,0:08:41.25,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1237,1)\fs20\c&H2A180E&\pos(489,29.5)\t(3073,3281,\alpha&H99&)}No Video Recording\N\N\N{\fs12}The following actions are strictly prohibited.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.86,0:08:41.25,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1237,1)\an7\fs12\c&H2A180E&\pos(352,89.5)\t(3073,3281,\alpha&H99&)}- Photography and videos for commercial purposes\N- Operating unmanned aircraft,\N\h\has well as aerial photography (drones, RC, etc.)\N- Photography and videos with selfie sticks\N- Extreme acts of photography that disturb others\N{\alpha&H00&\t(3073,3281,\fs14)}- Filming of NewTube videos (no exceptions!)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:41.25,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1237,1)\bord2\fs9\c&H563224&\3c&H1B1008&\pos(487,178.5)\t(3073,3281,\alpha&H99&)}Those found to be in violation will incur a fine of 10,000 yen.\NThank you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.12,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:38.19,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Double ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:41.25,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Apparently, they recently \Nbanned video recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:44.99,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We should discuss with you before \Nshooting a different video, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:48.67,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Time is of the essence, so we \Nditched the car and flew over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:50.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I see... Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.91,0:08:52.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have just called?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.30,0:08:55.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What? Don't be so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:56.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Get off! I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.89,0:08:57.68,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:08:59.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:02.21,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sakura-chan, got any good ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:03.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're asking {\i1}her?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:06.69,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,It seems like your only choice is \Nto film something around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:08.76,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:10.89,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,If you go somewhere else to film,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.89,0:09:12.69,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,you won't have enough\N time to edit the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:14.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:17.50,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But are there any interesting \Nplaces in this area?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:18.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.44,0:09:20.08,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's a normal neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:22.58,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(\fscx150)\fnArial Black\bord2\c&H1BC3F3&\3c&HF57D6C&}Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:24.01,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:25.08,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:28.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,How about, "I Returned to My Family Home"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:29.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:31.81,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Oh, I've seen videos like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.81,0:09:35.72,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Where they eat dinner as a family, \Nor read out letters of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:38.21,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Sure to bring warmth to your heart \N{\i1}and{\i0} a smile to your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.21,0:09:40.10,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Sounds good! Not that I'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:44.35,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be impossible, since we \Ndon't have family homes, but {\i1}you{\i0} do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:47.11,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:48.91,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,N-Not happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:50.53,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've never been in any of our videos!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.53,0:09:51.23,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,But you could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:54.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Everyone would throw a fit \Nif a new face suddenly showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.09,0:09:56.17,Default,Live,0,0,0,,But you're the only one who can!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:56.80,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:09:58.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Nope! Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:10:00.10,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:01.15,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.15,0:10:02.49,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:05.66,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Wanna go hit up some pachinko?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:07.12,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:11.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:13.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:16.01,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is your family home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:19.01,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:24.01,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(324,40)\c&H21FE5C&\3c&H319C66&\bord1}Standby
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:23.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The story is, your mother's in the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.23,0:10:27.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,so you came back home to take care \Nof your sister, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:29.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The rest you can feel free to make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.34,0:10:31.39,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay! I'm ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:33.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Also, don't call Sakura by her real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:34.65,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:38.10,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Shooting a video pretending that \Nthis is Live-sama's family home...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:40.78,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Masaki sure does comes up with some wild ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:41.69,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.69,0:10:45.74,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Is it okay to trick our audience like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.74,0:10:50.08,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Besides, won't we get busted in no time \Nif Masaki's friends watch this video?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:52.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've never had a friend come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:55.95,DefaultItalics,Group,0,0,0,,She doesn't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.95,0:10:57.17,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sakura, are you ready, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.72,0:11:00.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why are you pouting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.03,0:11:01.43,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'm against staged videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:05.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey, just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.56,0:11:09.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:10.99,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.99,0:11:11.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:15.32,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Today, we're at my family home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:16.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,This here's my little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:17.78,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:21.52,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Man, it's so relaxing being back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:24.75,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So nostalgic, you could even \Ncall it nostalgia-inducing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:25.91,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:27.38,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:32.92,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Now that we're back in my family home, \Nhow about a room tour?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:35.92,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Time to show you all my bedroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:37.80,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.65,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Is my diary here somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.65,0:11:41.25,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh! A photo album!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:43.43,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Where could my school uniform be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:46.26,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Or maybe some childhood clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:51.80,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What's this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:58.73,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H515D6C&\pos(221.5,32.5)\3c&H1E2E42&}Soba Restaurant Tachian
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:54.43,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,The diner we ate at often as a family...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.43,0:11:57.56,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,went out of business and now it's a \Nsoba joint which holds no memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:11:58.73,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Zero memories?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:06.88,Default,Live,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:08.92,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We ate here all the time as kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:10.73,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Seven times a week!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:12.37,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,So every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:15.50,Default,Live,0,0,0,,This shrimp tempura tastes \Njust like Mom's home cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:20.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I could go all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:22.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.09,0:12:23.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let's switch it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:25.22,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Bottoms up—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:27.65,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No outside food!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.65,0:12:28.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And that's the {\i1}least{\i0} of the issues!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:30.73,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live, you're fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:32.11,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Tokage, take over for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.11,0:12:32.75,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.10,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You need to avenge Live-sama's dead body!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:35.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:39.82,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Um, this is my family home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:40.98,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Here's my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:41.86,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:46.02,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Today, I'll be gazing out \Nat the snow on the veranda,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:49.24,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,while lazily reminiscing with \Nmy sister about when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:55.20,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Do you remember that game \Nwe used to always play, little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:58.25,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You've never played with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:13:00.82,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,What? That can't be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:02.33,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Like, what about tag?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.33,0:13:02.80,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:04.18,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Playing house?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:04.58,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:06.10,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Hide-and-seek?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:07.23,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Oh, there was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:09.72,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Right? Wasn't it fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:13.65,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You were "it," but you left me behind \Nand went back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:14.39,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:17.64,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:20.70,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to make you forget \Nthose sad memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:21.19,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:25.90,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'll play with you to your heart's content!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.21,0:13:29.41,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:32.66,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Nothing says snow like a snowball fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.04,0:13:39.79,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You're wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.62,0:13:45.92,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Yay! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:46.84,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Bada bing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:48.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Tokage's fired, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:53.86,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:55.25,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,This is my family home!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:58.95,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,And making her debut here is my little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.95,0:13:59.42,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:01.02,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:04.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,She looks older than you, \Nso {\i1}you'll{\i0} be the little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:05.21,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.44,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I've been alive for way longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:08.15,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.59,0:14:10.79,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You're older?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:16.52,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,And so, I'll be making a dish filled with \Nmemories with my big sister today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:20.72,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But what food is filled with memories for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:22.80,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I know how to make curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:23.59,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:27.32,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'd always make it whenever\N Mom was late coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:29.72,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,But you'd complain about \Nhow underseasoned it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.34,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,and add loads of soy sauce to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:35.79,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I do apologize for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.79,0:14:38.52,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Then you can just sit back \Nand wait while I cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:43.52,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Today, I'll make a delicious meal \Nfilled with memories for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.36,0:14:48.59,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Voilà!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:50.36,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,A meal filled with memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:53.42,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,A hundred years ago, when I was a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:56.62,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,we couldn't afford lots of food like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:15:01.22,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Mom always shared her fish \Nwith me and my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:04.10,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But I couldn't bear to see her go hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:07.86,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,so I would lie to her, \Nsaying I was full and didn't want any fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:08.34,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:12.64,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I told her, "You need to eat, Mom," \Nas I smiled with teary eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:13.60,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.73,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:18.13,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,We're here at my family home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.13,0:15:20.25,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,This is my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.46,0:15:22.86,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:24.49,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:27.36,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What?! You're gonna film this, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:29.86,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:32.49,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's just leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:34.99,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Thank you as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:41.31,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,My older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:42.75,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Oh, do forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:44.77,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,My eyes have been failing me lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.77,0:15:46.29,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Why, it's been ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:48.00,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,L-Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:49.58,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's Takeshita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:51.54,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,She makes food for us sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:52.41,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:57.33,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much \Nfor looking after my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:15:59.89,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Goodness, I hardly recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.89,0:16:00.96,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:06.70,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,You always stole Sakura-chan's New Year's \Nmoney and used it to buy toys for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:08.94,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,You sure have grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:12.45,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,But there's something about your voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:13.41,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:16.03,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Not to mention your height...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:19.74,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,U-Um, I-I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.66,0:16:24.79,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I'm her bona fide big sister! I swear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:29.05,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,After all, I've never been wrong in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:31.80,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Bow down before me, peasants!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.23,0:16:34.68,Default,Takeshita,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:36.75,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,P-Please forgive me for being so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:40.08,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.54,0:16:38.32,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.85,0:16:40.90,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm nothing like that, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:48.04,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Takeshita-san said she's okay \Nwith being in the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:49.17,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:51.40,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,What a nice old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:54.78,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Wait, so whose family home \Nare we saying this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:57.03,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let me have one more chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:16:57.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:17:00.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'll pull it off without a hitch this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:05.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We haven'y shot the\N family-thanking scene yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.38,0:17:07.42,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Guess we'll try it again with Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.29,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:11.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:17.14,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Um, I-I've only made it this far \Nthanks to my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Thanks, family. Thanks for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:22.01,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Family for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.01,0:17:23.55,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.55,0:17:25.01,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.01,0:17:30.32,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Um, I've caused a lot of trouble \Nfor my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:33.06,Default,Live,0,0,0,,But I didn't mean any harm by it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:36.45,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's more like my personality \Nis just kind of awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:38.97,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I regret all the things I've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:42.20,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So please support me going forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:47.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.93,0:17:48.54,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:49.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:51.21,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You eat my ice cream without asking,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.21,0:17:52.76,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,ditch me during hide-and-seek,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.53,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,complain about my cooking,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:56.34,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,and steal my New Year's money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:17:58.64,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You only do the things you want to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:01.19,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,you always act before you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:05.85,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,you left the house right after graduating \Nhigh school and made our mom worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:11.11,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,When you got booted from your channel, \Nyou were too stubborn to call us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.62,0:18:13.44,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You really are awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:17.61,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,So it's too late to ask me for your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:24.92,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,After all, I've been supporting you \Nfrom the very start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:33.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's a wrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:34.75,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Good job, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:36.51,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:38.78,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But we don't have time to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.78,0:18:42.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why? Because this video needs \Nto go up by tomorrow night!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.59,0:18:44.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We'll split up the editing \Nand tackle it as a group!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:46.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't count on getting any sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:46.93,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:48.81,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.81,0:18:49.85,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.29,0:18:51.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Without further ado,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:52.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"Investigation:"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:57.99,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(444,354)\fnTimes New Roman\an7\3c&HE8F4F4&\bord3\pos(227,18.5)}<Investigation>\N{\fs18\3c&H252A29&}How well can everyone act when asked to pretend a\Ncrew member's family home is their own family home?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.52,0:18:57.99,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(444,354)\fnTimes New Roman\an7\3c&H252A29&\bord1.5\pos(227,18.5)}<Investigation>\N{\fs18\3c&HE8F4F4&\c&H252A29&}How well can everyone {\c&H400DB7&}act{\c&H252A29&} when asked to {\c&H400DB7&}pretend{\c&H252A29&} a\Ncrew member's {\c&H400DB7&}family home{\c&H252A29&} is their own {\c&H400DB7&}family home{\c&H252A29&}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:55.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"How well can everyone act \Nwhen asked to pretend"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:58.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"a crew member's family home \Nis their own family home?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:19:00.86,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Video production starts... now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:04.27,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.69,0:19:26.64,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:28.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sakura, you've gotten better!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:31.77,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I thought you really were \Nmaking a staged video.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.11,0:19:34.83,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You know I'd never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.83,0:19:37.08,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You could have let me in on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:38.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:41.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm glad it looks like we'll make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:45.62,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:49.29,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Are you never going to be in a MayoPan video?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:50.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:55.04,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(939,1)\fs16\3c&H7E7E7E&\bord1\pos(320,41.5)}Recording
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.05,0:20:00.05,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\3c&H7E7E7E&\bord1\pos(320,41.5)}Recording
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:02.88,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Because of the scandal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:06.80,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Is it still on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:13.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I enjoy working behind the scenes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:20.44,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sorry for dropping by so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:22.24,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:24.70,Default,Live,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.17,0:20:26.70,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Um, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:30.53,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Could I have all of your autographs?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.53,0:20:32.79,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is one of your friends a \NMayoPan fan or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:35.71,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm{\i0} your fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:36.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.96,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I misspoke. I'm a {\i1}huge{\i0} fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.22,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:41.96,Default,Live,0,0,0,,R-Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:43.34,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:47.14,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,If you really, {\i1}really{\i0} love me that much, \Nyou should have told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:48.72,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,No, I couldn't possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:51.44,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Does that mean you watch my videos, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:52.52,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:56.23,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You were so cute when you teared up \Nbecause you messed up your cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.23,0:20:58.50,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I-I wasn't crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:20:59.86,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What about my singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:03.57,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's so wonderful, \NI can't even express it in words.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:05.46,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,It feels wrong to even try.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.46,0:21:06.82,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:07.97,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sakura-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:09.45,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Say something nice about me as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:12.05,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I could do that without even thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:13.58,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Your autographs, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:15.87,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm first!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:17.06,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wait, Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.26,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Don't sign in the middle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.26,0:21:19.85,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Give me the pink marker!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:21.63,DefaultTop,Fu,0,0,0,,Leave room for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:21.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.71,0:21:25.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.13,0:21:28.64,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H794CCD&\frz11.83\fax0.05\pos(346,58)}Ichiko
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.13,0:21:28.64,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fnArial Black\c&H50585A&\frz11.83\fax0.05\pos(282.667,183.334)}TOKAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.13,0:21:28.64,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\frz11.83\fax0.05\pos(486.666,295.334)\c&H4223CD&}Live <3
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.45,0:21:28.64,DefaultTop,Live,0,0,0,,Sakura-chan, here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:30.53,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:31.82,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:35.10,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.10,0:21:37.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way. I'm never even on camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:40.53,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hyped-Up Sisters. Mayonaka Punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:43.54,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'm your oldest fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.03,0:21:50.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You've always been a tough nut to crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.48,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\an7\c&H141719&\pos(280.5,6.5)}Live\NSent you a sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.48,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\c&HFEEFFA&\3c&HDFAAB5&\bord1.5\blur1\pos(449,56)}Goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:26.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:26.85,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.85,0:23:27.40,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:28.10,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Sakura here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:29.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You're so cute, Sakura-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.18,0:23:30.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Tiny Masaki! Mini-Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.57,0:23:31.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well, we {\i1}do{\i0} look alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.63,0:23:32.99,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,No, we don't. Don't ever say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:33.30,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.99,0:23:33.64,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You totally do!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:34.37,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Then yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.37,0:23:35.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:35.60,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\an7\bord2\fnCourier New\c&HE9E9E9&\3c&H057309&\pos(128,238)}Live "Neener, neener!\N\h\h\h\h\hShigeyuki, Shigeyuki!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.07,0:23:37.60,DefaultTop,Group,0,0,0,,Next time: "Rampage x Fateful Showdown!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.60,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFEFEFF&\1a&HCC&\pos(320,24.5)\c&H000000&}Rampage x Fateful Showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:40.02,Default,Live,0,0,0,,She's turned into {\i1}what{\i0} now?!
